cter (\"a\"), then the first character for the first font atlas, then the first character for the second font atlas (when the first gets filled up), and so on. For some reason, each individual atlas doesn't get updated on screen after the first character.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1243/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/762341414","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1161#issuecomment-762341414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1161","id":762341414,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc2MjM0MTQxNA==","user":{"login":"tigregalis","id":38416468,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDE2NDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38416468?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis","html_url":"https://github.com/tigregalis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tigregalis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-18T16:06:17Z","updated_at":"2021-01-18T16:06:17Z","body":"> \r\n> \r\n> The ability to change a texture