"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-17T10:42:42Z","updated_at":"2021-02-17T10:42:42Z","body":"The issue is that when changing the `Texture`, the `ColorMaterial` used to display it doesn't pick up the change and isn't updated itself.\r\n\r\nThis is a common issue to all assets that can contain handles to other assets, and that need to be updated when their included assets are.\r\n\r\nShort term fix would be to monitor the changes to `Texture` and trigger changes to related `ColorMaterial` but it adds complexity and overhead.\r\nLong term fix (for rendered assets) would be to move to \"pipelined\" rendering where render state is separate from world state.\r\n\r\nThis would still be a potential issue for assets that are not rendered.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/780467768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mockersf","id":8672791,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzI3OTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8672791?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf","html_url":"https://github.com/mockersf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mockersf/events{/privac